# Simple Sandbox Environment Configuration
# 
# This project primarily uses YAML configuration files (config/sandbox.yaml).
# Most configuration options have been moved to the YAML file for better organization.
# 
# The only environment variable currently used is SANDBOX_CONFIG to specify
# the path to the configuration file.

# Path to the sandbox configuration file (YAML format)
# Default: ./config/sandbox.yaml
# SANDBOX_CONFIG=./config/sandbox.yaml

# For all other configuration options (backend selection, concurrency settings,
# image repositories, security settings, etc.), please refer to and modify
# the config/sandbox.yaml file.
#
# Example configuration file can be found at: config/sandbox.yaml.example
